{"title":"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In one morning, a ferry traveled from Hong Kong to Kowloon and another ferry traveled from Kowloon to Hong Kong at a different speed. They started at the same time and met first time at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/0/8e09b4a40d983d03177e92bed2f16beb4d17dece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8:20$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. The two ferries then sailed to their destinations, stopped for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes and returned. The two ferries met again at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d786667ec0963b4049255df8ab8e71f3ba9af3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9:11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />. Suppose the two ferries traveled at a uniform speed throughout the whole journey, what time did the two ferries start their journey?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Time <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />, velocity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f23bf124b6b2b2a993eb313c72e678664ac74a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, distance <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82bf0d9cec9f3c2220aec106bb63b25d5b61ce73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v=\\frac{a}{t}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"33\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/2583b4daaa2c60018e83d31d9a4a3b34114ccbbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=v \\cdot t$\" width=\"62\" height=\"11\" />.\nTime of departure <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.\nFirst, ferry 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/e/85e33af9de5761bc7ec10b0073e1fb1ca06d0955.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{1}=v_{1}(8.20-T)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" /> and ferry 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054d25c4d1b5f6947eb88a50b8becab5e951ee7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2}=v_{2}(8.20-T)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" />; sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f78d9f543f11135b1dc90ffc7a9ae8cad45934d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=a_{1}+a_{2}=(v_{1}+v_{2})(8.20-T)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"263\" height=\"18\" />.\nSecond, difference in time: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/7/2b7ba7d8ea86d9ccb353aeb89dd81fc2b1470130.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9.11-8.20-0.15=0.36$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"197\" height=\"13\" />.\nFerry 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1e9ca6ea9a8a54ea7640efa3eaadd22a6581710.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2}+a_{4}=v_{1}\\cdot (0.36)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"20\" /> and ferry 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/7/dc7a68744858f0f68c66cee69024a753785f2432.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{1}+a_{3}=v_{2}\\cdot (0.36)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />; sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/1/c811cf2b6b49d85fceee0723bab52c9cbbd958d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a=(v_{1}+v_{2})(0.36)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"18\" />.\nDividing: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/2/f6245635cf8b442ce92c444aa5007c4e02660585.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{8.20-T}{0.36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"107\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7b75aafc63f8836ca7be7d0d4bce82056c8353d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=8.02$\" width=\"69\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC\" title=\"1997 PMWC\">1997 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T3\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T3\">Problem T3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T5\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T5\">Problem T5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I13\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I14\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I15\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I15\">15</a> <br /> T: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T1\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"